      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6699e3ad794910f5f90c3405",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们究竟能不能获得\n初代决胜系列赛冠军这个荣耀呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dce145dbe29e2572d9c85bbe886ec5aa09d36483b844ca93ee99f583d29b4d88",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efa5c53d31b064bf4ea71048",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即将举办“URA总决赛”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92d49a4814eccf85aa083115cbb1a062f23b9076ddf19b21291dad6c082d36c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eed6c7121c378b0ab541868",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然行事作风出人意表，但小不点理事长秋川\n对赛马娘的爱与热情却是无与伦比。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75344718a95c0f3e663cdcb3194f7b0b867916f9842d80adbb09833ce2d9894e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c59b2f7f88b7e214068fd0d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她表明了希望我能为“URA总决赛”\n推波助澜的意图。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47a25724cdce94403b5394613b0134b004682eaa721ca914043f42bd12c56eb7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c710170b1e4632ee1b845fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她要我将<chrname>培育成\n背负许多粉丝期待与梦想的存在──\n“巨星赛马娘”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1e974b1a04ca01fd62309cf2ab1e612f1b528d028fcba1af8d0f39908252f33",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57295d366e4a57cc6b8d739b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了达到这个目标，首先必须抓住许多人的心，\n增加粉丝的人数才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "534961d24f5f45f54317b10c14fcb81a03fb0dd858f66c4b2dc8a47db020087d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e29d0fc7bafa49e767662f75",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标是“巨星赛马娘”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f4076036cbf3d4a539f5f6d0cfd3054a5db6bf04640469fa07f432e0afc29d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6368dc04b7dd7f6ac24f1dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在我们为了“URA总决赛”\n而不断进行训练的某一天──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee20fee96efb2a068d7ed65839c0e1e4ec9ed0fddea24777aa11397014251b83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01d2f6c52fde2c005e332aa5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "遇见了跟我同期的优秀训练员\n“桐生院葵”以及她的\n签约赛马娘“快乐米可”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e28033f658c4adb16fce64c33ee6b9cd8666a7c8be7f3471a3abbebfa143227e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b3cc1f0ab74f1842da3281b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看着尽管笨拙却培养出情谊的两人，\n让我更加巩固了对自己签约赛马娘的心意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbd19c957e890807a73d3de525f8d3b36bb42e3dd312b39cd1d21913aaa58291",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:428553651d87de4ffc09ad97",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与精英训练员的相遇",
      "source_fingerprint": "804dd7cce2e3e1a4acb418017d23c7270944d442a1ee027b0649bf0bbf312bf8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c49350cdfad2661bbe70bd3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "随着“URA总决赛”的举办，\n我被安排要接受乙名史记者的采访。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0776df1bd730eed7a81e4d6878f135f2fb63bf4af10bc60e87e81d9390ef87c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5134e83d26828d2e40b4096f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然整个人遭到乙名史记者的可怕压力席卷，\n但我仍然以训练员的身份\n宣告自己会对<chrname>尽心尽力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3629ae9a7a7641fc4c312d97cdc830b8a73827bb8860606030d3b4dfc9a3283",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ec1c4d1e477b4cf829d1af0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但要成为“巨星赛马娘”的话，\n粉丝的人数还远远不足……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b28c4e559e0d576496cb87b0229b5face9d2657cc81282cb1a4ceb4bd1297a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1caac2f7317ebdb88d90f56e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是，我重新鼓起了干劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "910e327b1bab2f448708e87ab399017719181db5c1554ce971f00f40c9591ac8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6d3e9645d0e309b836d1442",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了能成为“巨星赛马娘”，\n我们吸引粉丝的进度颇为顺利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee15d055925a4ac4c08f02f7bb05981f7d83e5b65c8851f2a236ddf98bf62e23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30e48e0ecdae52c51a743fe4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就照这样继续加油吧，\n我如此打起精神并踏出了下一步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d26b40c17a6ba0396d292ab396507edaca9dd64eb75974a2aa7079a92d13eb3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d139cf5ff749733ef1dd1c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "初期的成果十分顺利，我们替成为\n“巨星赛马娘”这项目标留下不凡的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b72e546f2af788a6ca614b9e381d194bf41eb2f288b946efba553a1054ac85eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70ed0e7c8b21ea43079f6bbe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我坚定了自己的决心，\n必须继续维持这个状况。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c027d0bfcd20fa2a36f0fffdb59b0d1d6ead8f054eab56d7c6dae6eca803b87",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e94807431f606b0558e025c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怪人记者，登场！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ce6c2c139a7b9a8a9d7604acf53604ad2872e7c0a539f40f5bf11b1d0170725",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
